{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787949914721887001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"veryblue-pygmyish-swordfish","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"1a6e091a1aed80a15c59eab0f2f74d5a3e19c1d83dcd7a07b9ca2b791fd1c32f","event_uuid":"8e72c546-4dfa-4f52-b2c2-5071655ff1d1","position":{"commit_sha":"d423608b74fa40496621bf945eb0ae84126a1383","position":"1787941522681366001-8e72c546-4dfa-4f52-b2c2-5071655ff1d1"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"ce7db03c7f7bc6ffa46013db42410e26c2e8f023ef903326e22aba1b7d3921ff","event_uuid":"cfb0149b-f191-45a8-bf15-24398ed396c4","position":{"commit_sha":"c83d16195402330a62639770178b885497c22aca","position":"1787941541224451001-cfb0149b-f191-45a8-bf15-24398ed396c4"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787941522681366001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"cfb0149b-f191-45a8-bf15-24398ed396c4","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"c49a-225d-2bc0-4478"}],"description":"Discovered while fixing bug c49a-225d-2bc0-4478 (perplexed-jeanlike-kakarikis).\n\nThe check_wall_clock_asserts gate did not flag test_narrow_operation_persists_the_same_bytes_as_the_legacy_sequence, which flaked on a wall-clock boundary. The flake mechanism is INDIRECT: the test never asserts on a timestamp directly. Instead it asserts byte-equality between two files independently produced by BindingStore.save(), and each save stamps created_at/updated_at from the wall clock in product code (BindingLifecycle.bind_confirm -> _now_iso). When the two builds straddle a 1-second boundary the serialized bytes differ.\n\nThis is a gate blind spot: a byte/text-equality assertion between two artifacts that each embed wall-clock state (across separate builds, without a frozen clock) is a latent flake the current heuristic misses.\n\nPossible directions (design decision, not yet scoped):\n- Extend check_wall_clock_asserts to flag read_bytes()/read_text() equality assertions between two separately-produced artifacts in a test that does not freeze the clock (monkeypatch _now_iso / utc_now_iso), or\n- Audit the other cross-artifact byte-equality tests in tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/state/ (test_binding_lifecycle, test_get_rotation_*, test_binding_recovery, test_alert_store_atomic_write) for the same latent pattern.\n\nAcceptance criteria to be refined during planning; filing now as discovered follow-up so the gate gap is tracked rather than lost.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"f8c6-6ab3-ca81-4d30","ticket_type":"task","title":"check_wall_clock_asserts misses transitive timestamp flakes (byte-equality of independently-timestamped saves)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["8e72c546-4dfa-4f52-b2c2-5071655ff1d1","cfb0149b-f191-45a8-bf15-24398ed396c4"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787949914721887001,"uuid":"55ca8547-e756-499a-bca0-baa3ea429af3"}